OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers will continue tonight across
OL,7,Fthe north and west, with any
OL,8,Fthunderstorms soon easing. Drier
OL,9,Felsewhere with clear spells. Winds
OL,10,Feasing but staying breezy in the
OL,11,Fnorth, and feeling fresher for all of
OL,12,Fus than recent nights.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FDry for many on Wednesday
OL,15,Fwith partly cloudy skies and some
OL,16,Fbright spells. Scattered showers are
OL,17,Fpossible where the cloud thickens. A
OL,18,Ffresher feeling day for many, but
OL,19,Fwinds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
